to have a normal life.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:57.133
They can't get a job, can't join
the country club, but.

00:14:59.167 --> 00:15:02.234
I just like killed twice,
I guess, is like more palatable.

00:15:04.901 --> 00:15:08.400
And the last thing tonight is

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:12.701
