during brain surgery.

00:15:27.701 --> 00:15:29.834
And enough of you said that that
I believe that to be true.

00:15:29.834 --> 00:15:33.434
So you -- can you imagine that?

00:15:33.434 --> 00:15:35.801
People stay awake

00:15:35.801 --> 00:15:40.534
